OL,3,GNEWSAThe man helping hundreds from his
OL,4,Agarden shed food bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man whose food bank in York supports
OL,7,Fabout 100 people a day has said its
OL,8,Ffuture remains uncertain.
OL,10,FJohn McGall launched I Am Reusable
OL,11,FCommunity Food Bank in 2020 and has
OL,12,Fcontinued to run it from his garden
OL,13,Fshed since then.
OL,15,FHe was granted temporary planning
OL,16,Fpermission to continue operating from
OL,17,Fhis home on Aldborough Way in 2024 by
OL,18,FCity of York Council.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
